    p('''The 0.60 mm nominal choice delivers 80.21%, only 0.21 percentage points above the benchmark. Its 141.18 cm² lateral area is 22.28% above nominal; its active single-row footprint is 52.85 versus 40.95 cm² (+29.1%), and nine versus seven pouches is +28.6%. The 1 mm spacing and 70 mm longest segment define this footprint. It excludes the generator, connectors, manifolds, implantation clearances and tissue accommodation. These costs are not interchangeable (Figure 3).''')
    fig('dose_area_frontier.png','Favorable-scenario delivery versus lateral area at fixed dose. A shows the full tested grid; B enlarges 90–220 cm² and marks nominal geometry and the 80% and 90% choices at 30 minutes. Horizontal lines are engineering benchmarks. Annular end area and system overhead are excluded from the plotted lateral area.')
    h('5 Scenario-qualified design requirements')
