    p('''Papas-derived HSA- and FBS-culture values in the BEAM supplement describe different preparations, not paired basal/stimulated states [6]. Other consumption values remain unpaired scenarios. Wang supplies dynamic oxygen-response context [7], while the Papas review surveys oxygenation strategies [8]; neither is used to invent a device-specific bound. For a symbolic external amount B required by T under the same uniform constant production, mean intrinsic secretion per IEQ must be at least B/[NTη(T)]. No patient demand is assigned, and hour-long external GSIS measurements are not substituted for minute-scale intrinsic secretion.''')
    h('9 Reproducibility and provenance')
